stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Draft: created on the Prompts page or by POST versions
  [*] --> Active: seeded from a file with status active
  [*] --> Retired: seeded from a file with status retired
  Draft --> Active: activated
  Active --> Retired: another version of the key is activated
  Retired --> Active: rollback, activated again
  note right of Active
    One active version per key.
    New AI calls use it at once.
    Past analyses keep their
    key, version and sha256.
  end note
